\r\n<div>                &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>        &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;/section&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;!-- SECTION 1A — ABOUT THE INSTITUTION --&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;section class=\"about-section\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>        &lt;div class=\"container\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;div class=\"about-heading\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;div class=\"about-label\"&gt;About the Institution&lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;h2 class=\"about-title\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    Rooted in &lt;span class=\"orange\"&gt;Tradition&lt;/span&gt;,</div>\r\n<div>                    Growing with &lt;span class=\"orange\"&gt;Purpose&lt;/span&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;/h2&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;div class=\"about-grid\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;div class=\"about-text\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        The school falls under the umbrella of the</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;strong&gt;Shree Mahalingeshwara Temple Education Trust&lt;/strong&gt;,</div>\r\n<div>                        a non-profit body affiliated with the temple of the same name.</div>\r\n<div>                        It is situated in a calm and tranquil location on the temple</div>\r\n<div>                        grounds in &lt;strong&gt;Kunjathur village&lt;/strong&gt;, approximately</div>\r\n<div>                        3 kilometres from the town centre.</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        The institution is affiliated with</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;strong&gt;NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling), New Delhi&lt;/strong&gt;,</div>\r\n<div>                        under the Right to Education Act of 2009. The school received</div>\r\n<div>                        accredita