       what is learned becomes what is lived.</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            This is not an add-on to the school day, but the rhythm</div>\r\n<div>                            of it. Every week, every activity, and every interaction</div>\r\n<div>                            is quietly shaped by these five streams — creating a</div>\r\n<div>                            learning environment where the mind and character grow</div>\r\n<div>                            together, and where a child leaves not just with</div>\r\n<div>                            knowledge, but with a way of being.</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;div class=\"panchang-closing-note\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                                Together, these five areas form the rhythm of a</div>\r\n<div>                                school day that nourishes both mind and character.</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;!-- RIGHT — featured image --&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;div class=\"panchang-visual-col\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;div class=\"panchang-image-wrap\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;div class=\"panchang-image-accent\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;figure&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                                &lt;img</div>\r\n<div>                                    src=\"images/media/image4.png\"</div>\r\n<div>                                    alt=\"Students practicing Yoga and Meditation — Panchangashikshan at SMVK\"</div>\r\n<div>                                    title=\"Panchangashikshan Framework at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"</