g-pillar-header\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\"&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                            &lt;i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill panchang-pillar-icon\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;h4&gt;Naithik&lt;/h4&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;p&gt;Moral education and inner character — the quiet strength that guides every choice.&lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>        &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;/section&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;!-- SECTION 2 — LEARNING ENVIRONMENT --&gt;</div>\r\n<div>    &lt;section class=\"learning-section\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>        &lt;div class=\"container\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;div class=\"learning-heading\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;h2 class=\"learning-title\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    A Learning Environment&lt;br&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    Built on &lt;span class=\"orange\"&gt;Freedom &amp;amp; Truth&lt;/span&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;/h2&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;p class=\"learning-sub\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    Where academic learning meets moral, physical, cultural, and</div>\r\n<div>                    spiritual growth — nurturing every child completely.</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;/p&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;/div&gt;</div>\r\n<div>            &lt;div class=\"learning-grid\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                &lt;div class=\"learning-card\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                    &lt;div class=\"learning-card-media\"&gt;</div>\r\n<div>                        &lt;img</div>\r\n<div>                            src=\"images/media/image14.png\"</div>\r\n<div>                            alt=\"Smart Digital Classroom and Curriculum at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"</d