lenged.\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Our approach at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana is rooted\r\n                    in <strong>values</strong>. We follow the NCERT-guided\r\n                    curriculum and hold affiliation with <strong>NIOS, New Delhi</strong>,\r\n                    but equally important to us is what happens beyond the\r\n                    syllabus — the daily meditation, the physical activity, the\r\n                    music, the craft, the yoga, and the quiet cultivation of\r\n                    character through the principle of <strong>\"living in truth.\"</strong>\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Our teachers are the heart of this institution. I have watched\r\n                    them sit with children in meditation, guide a struggling\r\n                    student with patience, and celebrate every small victory as\r\n                    if it were their own. They carry the kind of freedom that a\r\n                    mother gives — the freedom to nurture, to correct gently, and\r\n                    to love unconditionally. That, to me, is the true foundation\r\n                    of a good school.\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    To our parents — thank you for trusting us with your children.\r\n                    That trust is the most valuable thing you can give us, and we\r\n                    do not take it lightly. To our students — you are the reason\r\n                    we do what we do. I hope you leave this school not just with\r\n                    good marks, but with a strong heart, a clear mind, and a\r\n                    lifelong love for learning.\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Together — as teachers, parents and the community — we can\r\n                    continue to shape responsible citizens who serve their family,\r\n                    their country and the wider world with humility and purpose.\r\n                    That is our shared vision, and my personal commitment.\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Signature -->\r\n                <div class=\"principal-signature\">\r\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-quote\"></i>\r\n                    <h4>Mrs. Kusuma M P</h4>\r\n                    <span>Principal, Shree Mahalingeshwara Temple Education Trust</span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'principals-message', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '48-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 10:54:44', '2026-10-13 10:54:44', '', 48, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=49', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(50, 1, '2026-10-13 11:33:23', '2026-10-13 11:33:23', '<main>\r\n    <!-- SECTION 1 — CURRICULUM OVERVIEW -->\r\n    <section class=\"curriculum-overview\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-heading\">\r\n                <div class=\"curriculum-label\">Curriculum Overview</div>\r\n                <h2 class=\"curriculum-title\">\r\n                    Academics Rooted in <span class=\"orange\">Values</span>,\r\n                    Open to the <span class=\"orange\">World</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"curriculum-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"curriculum-text\">\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The academic programme at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\r\n                        follows the <strong>NCERT-guided curriculum</strong>, delivered\r\n                        under our affiliation with <strong>NIOS (National Institute of\r\n                        Open Schooling), New Delhi</strong>. The syllabus spans\r\n                        <strong>Grade 1 through Grade 8</strong> — giving students a\r\n                        complete foundational and middle school education within a single,\r\n                        values-rooted campus.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        But the curriculum here is more than a list of subjects. Every\r\n                        lesson, every activity, and every school day is shaped by the\r\n                        principle of <strong>\"living in truth\"</strong> — the idea\r\n                        that knowledge must be held together with character, and that\r\n                        what a child learns in the classroom should eventually serve\r\n                        the wider community.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The school draws on <strong>India\'s ancient philosophical\r\n                        traditions</strong>, its cultural legacy, and the wisdom of\r\n                        respected teachers worldwide. Students are introduced to\r\n                        lesser-known figures from Indian history, and given hands-on\r\n                        exposure to farming and the dignity of labour — so that\r\n                        learning stays connected to life, and life stays connected\r\n                        to learning. By the time a student completes\r\n                        <strong>Grade 8</strong>, they leave with a strong academic\r\n                        foundation, a formed character, and a clear sense of purpose.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"curriculum-tags\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-building\"></i> NIOS, New Delhi</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i> NCERT-Guided</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower2\"></i> \"Living in Truth\"</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i> Indian Heritage</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i> Community Service</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"curriculum-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"curriculum-image-wrap\">\r\n                        <div class=\"curriculum-image-accent\"></div>\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-curriculum.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Curriculum at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Academic Curriculum and Classroom Learning at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                class=\"curriculum-image\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Comprehensive academic curriculum, NCERT guidance, NIOS accreditation, and Panchangashikshan holistic education at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana Kunjathur.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"curriculum-accreditation\">\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-building\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>NIOS, New Delhi</strong>\r\n                            <span>Affiliated Institution</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-patch-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>OB0918317</strong>\r\n                            <span>Accreditation No.</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>Grade 1 – 8</strong>\r\n                            <span>Classes Offered</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 2 — ACADEMIC SUBJECTS (TWO-LEVEL CURRICULUM) -->\r\n    <section class=\"subjects-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"subjects-block\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"subjects-heading\">\r\n                    <div class=\"curriculum-label\">Academic Subjects</div>\r\n                    <h3 class=\"subjects-title\">\r\n                        What Students <span>Learn</span>\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"curriculum-levels\">\r\n\r\n                    <!-- CURRICULUM FOR CLASSES I TO IV -->\r\n                    <div class=\"level-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"level-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"level-icon\">\r\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-book\"></i>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"level-header-text\">\r\n                                <span class=\"level-tag\">Primary</span>\r\n                                <h4>Classes I – IV</h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"level-subjects\">\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">English</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-alphabet\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Malayalam / Kannada</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-chat-quote\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Hindi</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-calculator\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Mathematics</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-tree\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Environmental Studies</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-pc-display\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Computer Education</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Art Education</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Life Skills</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Value Education</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-walking\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Physical Education</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">General Knowledge</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Music</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- CURRICULUM FOR CLASSES V TO VIII -->\r\n                    <div class=\"level-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"level-header\">\r\n                            <div class=\"level-icon\">\r\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard\"></i>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"level-header-text\">\r\n                                <span class=\"level-tag\">Middle School</span>\r\n                                <h4>Classes V – VIII</h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"level-subjects\">\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">English</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-chat-quote\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Hindi</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-translate\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">\r\n                                    Third Language\r\n                                    <small>Malayalam / Kannada / Sanskrit</small>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-calculator\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Mathematics</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-flask\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Science</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Social Science</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Value Education</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">Life Skills</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"level-subject-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-pc-display\"></i></div>\r\n                                <div class=\"level-subject-name\">\r\n                                    Work Experience\r\n                                    <small>Computer Science</small>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 3 — PANCHANGASHIKSHAN IN CURRICULUM -->\r\n    <section class=\"panchang-curriculum\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-heading\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"panchang-curriculum-title\">\r\n                    The <span class=\"orange\">Panchangashikshan</span><br>\r\n                    Framework in Practice\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p class=\"panchang-curriculum-sub\">\r\n                    Five streams run through every week of the academic\r\n                    calendar — from Grade 1 to Grade 8 — not as add-ons,\r\n                    but as the rhythm of the school day itself.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Yoga</h3>\r\n                    <p>Stillness, breath, and physical well-being.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-person-walking\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Sports</h3>\r\n                    <p>Discipline, energy, and team spirit.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Music</h3>\r\n                    <p>Expression, rhythm, and creative confidence.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Sanskrit</h3>\r\n                    <p>Heritage, language, and ancient wisdom.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-curriculum-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Naithik</h3>\r\n                    <p>Moral education and inner character.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 4 — TEACHING METHODOLOGY -->\r\n    <section class=\"methodology-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"methodology-heading\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"methodology-title\">\r\n                    How We <span class=\"orange\">Teach</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p class=\"methodology-sub\">\r\n                    The classroom here is a place of discovery — where the\r\n                    mind is engaged, the heart is formed, and the child is\r\n                    always at the centre, from Grade 1 through Grade 8.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"methodology-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Small, Attentive Classrooms</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Classes are kept intentionally small so that every\r\n                            child receives personal attention — and no child\r\n                            is allowed to quietly fall behind, at any grade.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Learning by Doing</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Concepts are introduced through activity, observation,\r\n                            and experience — so that understanding runs deeper\r\n                            than memory, from primary years through middle school.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-flower2\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Meditation Before Lessons</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            The school day begins with quiet meditation — a\r\n                            practice that settles the mind and prepares the\r\n                            child for focused learning, at every age.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-person-heart\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Teachers as Mentors</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Our teachers carry the kind of freedom a mother has —\r\n                            the freedom to nurture, to correct gently, and to\r\n                            guide each child with patience across the years.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Rooted in Indian Heritage</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            The curriculum draws on India\'s ancient philosophical\r\n                            traditions, its cultural legacy, and the lives of\r\n                            lesser-known figures from Indian history.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"methodology-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"methodology-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <h3>Dignity of Labour</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Students receive hands-on exposure to farming and\r\n                            physical work — learning early that every form of\r\n                            honest effort deserves respect.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 5 — CLASSES & ASSESSMENT -->\r\n    <section class=\"classes-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"classes-heading\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"classes-title\">\r\n                    Classes &amp; <span class=\"orange\">Assessment</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p class=\"classes-sub\">\r\n                    A complete academic journey from Grade 1 to Grade 8 —\r\n                    with evaluation that supports learning rather than\r\n                    merely measuring it.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"classes-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- Left card — Classes -->\r\n                <div class=\"classes-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"classes-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Classes Offered (Grade 1 – 8)</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The school offers a continuous, structured programme\r\n                        from <strong>Grade 1 through Grade 8</strong>, following\r\n                        the NCERT-guided curriculum under NIOS affiliation.\r\n                        Admissions are open every January for the academic\r\n                        session beginning in June.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"classes-list\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"classes-list-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"classes-list-num\">1–4</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"classes-list-body\">\r\n                                <strong>Primary Years</strong>\r\n                                <span>Joyful learning — language, numeracy, environmental studies, and early habits of curiosity.</span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"classes-list-item\">\r\n                            <div class=\"classes-list-num\">5–8</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"classes-list-body\">\r\n                                <strong>Middle School</strong>\r\n                                <span>Deeper concepts in science, mathematics, and social science — with growing independence.</span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Right card — Assessment -->\r\n                <div class=\"classes-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"classes-card-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-clipboard-check\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Examination &amp; Evaluation</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Evaluation at the school is <strong>continuous and\r\n                        supportive</strong> — designed to identify where a child\r\n                        needs help, and to celebrate where a child excels. It\r\n                        is never used to rank or compare, but to guide.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Assessment includes <strong>periodic written tests,\r\n                        oral evaluations, project work, and classroom\r\n                        participation</strong>. Equal weight is given to a\r\n                        student\'s progress in yoga, sports, music, and\r\n                        character formation — because a report card should\r\n                        reflect the whole child, not just the marks.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        In <strong>Grade 6, 7, and 8</strong>, students are\r\n                        prepared with structured revision, practice tests, and\r\n                        one-to-one mentoring — building a strong academic base\r\n                        for higher studies. Parents receive regular feedback\r\n                        through <strong>parent-teacher meetings</strong> and\r\n                        written progress reports, so that school and home\r\n                        can work together in the child\'s interest.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 6 — CO-CURRICULAR ACTIVITIES -->\r\n    <section class=\"cocurricular-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cocurricular-heading\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"cocurricular-title\">\r\n                    Co-Curricular <span class=\"orange\">Activities</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p class=\"cocurricular-sub\">\r\n                    Learning does not stop at the classroom door. Every child —\r\n                    from Grade 1 to Grade 8 — is encouraged to explore,\r\n                    create, and grow beyond books.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cocurricular-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Yoga &amp; Meditation</strong>\r\n                        <span>Daily practice for physical and mental well-being.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Music &amp; Classical Arts</strong>\r\n                        <span>Vocal, instrumental, and classical music training.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Bharatanatyam</strong>\r\n                        <span>Classical dance as a form of cultural expression.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Karate</strong>\r\n                        <span>Self-defence, discipline, and physical confidence.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Craft &amp; Art</strong>\r\n                        <span>Creativity, imagination, and hands-on skill.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Sports &amp; Athletics</strong>\r\n                        <span>Team spirit, fitness, and healthy competition.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-tree\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Farming Exposure</strong>\r\n                        <span>Hands-on contact with the dignity of labour.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Sanskrit &amp; Heritage</strong>\r\n                        <span>Cultural roots and ancient wisdom.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cocurricular-item\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cocurricular-body\">\r\n                        <strong>Community Service</strong>\r\n                        <span>Learning to serve the school, the village, and the world.</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 7 — CLOSING QUOTE -->\r\n    <section class=\"curriculum-closing\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <p>\r\n                Eight years of learning — from the first alphabet in Grade 1\r\n                to the completion of middle school in Grade 8 — designed not\r\n                only to produce good students, but to shape good human\r\n                beings who serve their community, their country, and\r\n                humanity as a whole.\r\n            </p>\r\n            <div class=\"closing-note\">\r\n                Every Child Matters\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n</main>', 'Curriculum', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '36-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 11:33:23', '2026-10-13 11:33:23', '', 36, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=50', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(51, 1, '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         1. OUR APPROACH\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-approach\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"ee-approach-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-approach-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Our Approach</div>\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        A Dynamic System for <em>Holistic Growth</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Our education is a dynamic system designed to promote\r\n                        <strong>holistic development</strong> — where every\r\n                        child grows not just in knowledge, but in character,\r\n                        curiosity, and confidence.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        We follow a <strong>continuous and comprehensive\r\n                        evaluation pattern</strong> that helps students build\r\n                        on their strengths and achieve their best. Rather\r\n                        than measuring a child by a single examination, we\r\n                        look at their growth across the whole year.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        This approach keeps the child at the centre of every\r\n                        decision — so that learning remains a joyful,\r\n                        personal, and meaningful journey.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-approach-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/exam-approach.png\"\r\n                            alt=\"Students collaborating on hands-on practical experiments at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            title=\"Continuous and Comprehensive Evaluation\"\r\n                            class=\"ee-approach-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                            Continuous and comprehensive evaluation methods engaging students in practical problem solving and active learning.\r\n                        </figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         2. ASSESSMENT COMPONENTS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-components\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Assessment Components</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    How We <em>Assess Learning</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Evaluation is based on a combination of formative\r\n                    and summative assessments — so that the full picture\r\n                    of a child\'s progress is always visible.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-comp-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-journal-check\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Periodic Tests</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Regular tests conducted throughout the term to\r\n                        assess understanding of concepts as they are\r\n                        taught.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Term Examinations</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Comprehensive evaluation at the end of each term —\r\n                        covering the full syllabus with structured marking.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-easel2-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Assignments &amp; Projects</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Application of knowledge through practical work,\r\n                        creative projects, and hands-on activities.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Class Participation</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Active involvement in classroom discussions,\r\n                        activities, and collaborative learning.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         3. EVALUATION PATTERN\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-pattern\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Evaluation Pattern</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A Structure that <em>Grows with the Child</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    The weightage for different assessments may vary by\r\n                    class level as per the school policy — with each stage\r\n                    focused on what matters most for that age group.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-pattern-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 1 — Classes I to IV -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-blue\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Classes I to IV</h3>\r\n                            <small>Foundation Years</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Periodic Assessments</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Term Examinations</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Class Assignments</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Co-curricular Activities</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Overall Development</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 2 — Classes V to VIII -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-green\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Classes V to VIII</h3>\r\n                            <small>Middle School</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Periodic Tests</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Term Examinations</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Assignments &amp; Projects</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Subject-wise Evaluation</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Co-curricular Activities</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Life Skills &amp; Values</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 3 — Key Focus Areas -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-orange\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Key Focus Areas</h3>\r\n                            <small>What We Look For</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Conceptual Understanding</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Application of Knowledge</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Analytical &amp; Critical Thinking</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Creativity &amp; Problem Solving</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Communication Skills</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Overall Personality Development</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         4. OUR COMMITMENT\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-commitment\">\r\n        <div class=\"ee-commitment-inner\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-commitment-visual\">\r\n                <figure>\r\n                    <img\r\n                        src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/exam-commitment.png\"\r\n                        alt=\"Teacher guiding and mentoring students in science laboratory at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                        title=\"Fair and Transparent Assessment Commitment\"\r\n                    >\r\n                    <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                        Faculty mentorship and transparent evaluation guiding student growth, conceptual clarity, and confidence.\r\n                    </figcaption>\r\n                </figure>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-commitment-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-commitment-label\">Our Commitment</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    Fair, Transparent &amp; <em>Encouraging</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    We are committed to <strong>fair and transparent\r\n                    evaluation</strong> that encourages students to learn,\r\n                    improve, and grow into <strong>confident, responsible,\r\n                    and well-rounded individuals</strong>.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Every mark, every remark, and every conversation with\r\n                    parents is guided by a single intention — to help the\r\n                    child take the next step, not to compare them with\r\n                    anyone else.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'Examination & Evaluation', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'examination-and-evaluation', '', '', '2026-10-14 10:29:22', '2026-10-14 10:29:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?page_id=51', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(52, 1, '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         1. OUR APPROACH\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-approach\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"ee-approach-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-approach-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Our Approach</div>\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        A Dynamic System for <em>Holistic Growth</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Our education is a dynamic system designed to promote\r\n                        <strong>holistic development</strong> — where every\r\n                        child grows not just in knowledge, but in character,\r\n                        curiosity, and confidence.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        We follow a <strong>continuous and comprehensive\r\n                        evaluation pattern</strong> that helps students build\r\n                        on their strengths and achieve their best. Rather\r\n                        than measuring a child by a single examination, we\r\n                        look at their growth across the whole year.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        This approach keeps the child at the centre of every\r\n                        decision — so that learning remains a joyful,\r\n                        personal, and meaningful journey.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-approach-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/exam-approach.png\"\r\n                            alt=\"Students collaborating on hands-on practical experiments at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            title=\"Continuous and Comprehensive Evaluation\"\r\n                            class=\"ee-approach-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                            Continuous and comprehensive evaluation methods engaging students in practical problem solving and active learning.\r\n                        </figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         2. ASSESSMENT COMPONENTS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-components\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Assessment Components</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    How We <em>Assess Learning</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Evaluation is based on a combination of formative\r\n                    and summative assessments — so that the full picture\r\n                    of a child\'s progress is always visible.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-comp-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-journal-check\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Periodic Tests</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Regular tests conducted throughout the term to\r\n                        assess understanding of concepts as they are\r\n                        taught.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Term Examinations</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Comprehensive evaluation at the end of each term —\r\n                        covering the full syllabus with structured marking.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-easel2-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Assignments &amp; Projects</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Application of knowledge through practical work,\r\n                        creative projects, and hands-on activities.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ee-comp-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Class Participation</h3>\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-comp-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Active involvement in classroom discussions,\r\n                        activities, and collaborative learning.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         3. EVALUATION PATTERN\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-pattern\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-sec-label\">Evaluation Pattern</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A Structure that <em>Grows with the Child</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    The weightage for different assessments may vary by\r\n                    class level as per the school policy — with each stage\r\n                    focused on what matters most for that age group.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-pattern-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 1 — Classes I to IV -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-blue\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Classes I to IV</h3>\r\n                            <small>Foundation Years</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Periodic Assessments</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Term Examinations</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Class Assignments</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Co-curricular Activities</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Overall Development</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 2 — Classes V to VIII -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-green\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Classes V to VIII</h3>\r\n                            <small>Middle School</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Periodic Tests</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Term Examinations</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Assignments &amp; Projects</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Subject-wise Evaluation</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Co-curricular Activities</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\"></i><span>Life Skills &amp; Values</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Panel 3 — Key Focus Areas -->\r\n                <div class=\"ee-panel ee-panel-orange\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ee-panel-head\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ee-panel-head-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3>Key Focus Areas</h3>\r\n                            <small>What We Look For</small>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <ul class=\"ee-panel-list\">\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Conceptual Understanding</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Application of Knowledge</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Analytical &amp; Critical Thinking</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Creativity &amp; Problem Solving</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Communication Skills</span></li>\r\n                        <li><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i><span>Overall Personality Development</span></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         4. OUR COMMITMENT\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ee-section ee-commitment\">\r\n        <div class=\"ee-commitment-inner\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-commitment-visual\">\r\n                <figure>\r\n                    <img\r\n                        src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/exam-commitment.png\"\r\n                        alt=\"Teacher guiding and mentoring students in science laboratory at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                        title=\"Fair and Transparent Assessment Commitment\"\r\n                    >\r\n                    <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                        Faculty mentorship and transparent evaluation guiding student growth, conceptual clarity, and confidence.\r\n                    </figcaption>\r\n                </figure>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ee-commitment-content\">\r\n                <div class=\"ee-commitment-label\">Our Commitment</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    Fair, Transparent &amp; <em>Encouraging</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    We are committed to <strong>fair and transparent\r\n                    evaluation</strong> that encourages students to learn,\r\n                    improve, and grow into <strong>confident, responsible,\r\n                    and well-rounded individuals</strong>.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Every mark, every remark, and every conversation with\r\n                    parents is guided by a single intention — to help the\r\n                    child take the next step, not to compare them with\r\n                    anyone else.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'examination-and-evaluation', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '51-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '2026-10-13 11:58:02', '', 51, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=52', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(53, 1, '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         1. OUR TEACHING PHILOSOPHY\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"tm-section tm-philosophy\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"tm-philosophy-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-philosophy-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Our Philosophy</div>\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        Where Curiosity Meets <em>Meaningful Action</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        At Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana, we believe\r\n                        that true education goes far beyond rote memorisation.\r\n                        Our classrooms are vibrant spaces where\r\n                        <strong>students are active explorers</strong>, encouraged to\r\n                        question, investigate, and construct their own understanding.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Rooted in the timeless Indian educational principle of\r\n                        <strong>Panchangashikshan</strong> and guided by modern\r\n                        child-centric pedagogy, we weave experiential learning,\r\n                        collaborative projects, and thoughtful technology into a\r\n                        single, harmonious journey.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Every child learns at their own pace, and every teacher\r\n                        serves as a dedicated mentor guiding both academic mastery\r\n                        and moral character.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-philosophy-badges\">\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-hearts\"></i> Child-Centric Approach</span>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i> Inquiry-Driven Lessons</span>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-flower2\"></i> Values-Rooted Learning</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-philosophy-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"<?php echo get_stylesheet_directory_uri(); ?>/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-event1.jpg\"\r\n                            alt=\"Active learning session at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"tm-philosophy-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Active learning, classroom teaching, and interactive academic session at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana</figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         2. THE 8 CORE METHODOLOGY PILLARS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"tm-section tm-methods\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Our Pedagogical Framework</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    8 Core Pillars of <em>Effective Teaching</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    A balanced synthesis of hands-on discovery, collaborative\r\n                    inquiry, individualized mentoring, and modern tech infusion.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-methods-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1. Interactive Learning Platform -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-display\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Interactive</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Interactive Learning Platform</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Dynamic &amp; Participatory Spaces</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Engaging digital modules and interactive classroom sessions\r\n                        transform complex abstract theories into lively, multi-sensory\r\n                        experiences that invite student participation.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2. Project-Based Learning -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Experiential</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Project-Based Learning</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Real-World Problem Solving</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Students investigate real-life questions, build working\r\n                        scientific models, and conduct field experiments that connect\r\n                        textbook knowledge directly to the world around them.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3. Classroom Model -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-easel2-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Pedagogy</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Classroom Model</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Learner-Centric Environment</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtfully arranged classroom spaces replace passive\r\n                        lectures with lively Socratic dialogues, thematic learning\r\n                        stations, and supportive peer-teacher conversations.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 4. Learning Through Games -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-dice-5-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Gamified</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Learning Through Games</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Joyful Cognitive Mastery</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Structured educational games, mathematical puzzles, logic\r\n                        challenges, and language quests make mastering foundational\r\n                        concepts stimulating, memorable, and fun.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 5. Individualized Instruction -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Tailored</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Individualized Instruction</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Respecting Every Child’s Pace</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Personalized attention and diagnostic feedback ensure that\r\n                        every child receives the right balance of remedial reinforcement\r\n                        and advanced intellectual enrichment.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 6. Collaborative Learning Process -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Teamwork</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Collaborative Learning Process</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Synergy, Empathy &amp; Leadership</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Group investigations, peer tutoring, and team presentations\r\n                        foster active listening, cooperative problem solving, and mutual\r\n                        respect among diverse peer groups.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 7. Learning Through Play -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-balloon-heart-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Foundation</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Learning Through Play</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Early Childhood Discovery</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Particularly emphasized in pre-primary and early primary\r\n                        stages: tactile exploration, storytelling, music, arts, and\r\n                        role-play nurture innate curiosity and emotional wellness.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 8. Classroom with a Tech Infusion -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-cpu-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Digital</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Classroom with a Tech Infusion</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Smart &amp; Purposeful Tools</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtful integration of audiovisual aids, e-learning resources,\r\n                        and digital media enriches classroom discourse while maintaining\r\n                        essential handwriting and reading disciplines.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         3. 4-STAGE LEARNING JOURNEY\r\n    =========================================================  -->\r\n    <!-- <section class=\"tm-section tm-journey\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Learning Progression</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    The 4-Stage <em>Learning Cycle</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    How every lesson unfolds to ensure deep comprehension,\r\n                    practical mastery, and long-term retention.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-journey-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">01</div>\r\n                    <h3>Spark &amp; Inquire</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Lessons open with thought-provoking questions, real-life\r\n                        scenarios, or intriguing demonstrations that spark natural\r\n                        curiosity and active questioning.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">02</div>\r\n                    <h3>Explore &amp; Experiment</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Students investigate through hands-on activities, educational\r\n                        games, digital simulations, and collaborative group tasks.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">03</div>\r\n                    <h3>Synthesize &amp; Mentor</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Teachers guide students to organize their findings, bridging\r\n                        practical observations with formal academic theories and\r\n                        individualized feedback.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">04</div>\r\n                    <h3>Reflect &amp; Apply</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Learners demonstrate mastery by creating projects, solving novel\r\n                        problems, and reflecting on how their knowledge connects to life.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'Teaching Methodology', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'teaching-methodology', '', '', '2026-10-14 10:29:37', '2026-10-14 10:29:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?page_id=53', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(54, 1, '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         1. OUR TEACHING PHILOSOPHY\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"tm-section tm-philosophy\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"tm-philosophy-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-philosophy-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Our Philosophy</div>\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        Where Curiosity Meets <em>Meaningful Action</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        At Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana, we believe\r\n                        that true education goes far beyond rote memorisation.\r\n                        Our classrooms are vibrant spaces where\r\n                        <strong>students are active explorers</strong>, encouraged to\r\n                        question, investigate, and construct their own understanding.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Rooted in the timeless Indian educational principle of\r\n                        <strong>Panchangashikshan</strong> and guided by modern\r\n                        child-centric pedagogy, we weave experiential learning,\r\n                        collaborative projects, and thoughtful technology into a\r\n                        single, harmonious journey.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Every child learns at their own pace, and every teacher\r\n                        serves as a dedicated mentor guiding both academic mastery\r\n                        and moral character.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-philosophy-badges\">\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-hearts\"></i> Child-Centric Approach</span>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i> Inquiry-Driven Lessons</span>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-philo-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-flower2\"></i> Values-Rooted Learning</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-philosophy-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"<?php echo get_stylesheet_directory_uri(); ?>/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-event1.jpg\"\r\n                            alt=\"Active learning session at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"tm-philosophy-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Active learning, classroom teaching, and interactive academic session at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana</figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         2. THE 8 CORE METHODOLOGY PILLARS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"tm-section tm-methods\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Our Pedagogical Framework</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    8 Core Pillars of <em>Effective Teaching</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    A balanced synthesis of hands-on discovery, collaborative\r\n                    inquiry, individualized mentoring, and modern tech infusion.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-methods-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1. Interactive Learning Platform -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-display\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Interactive</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Interactive Learning Platform</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Dynamic &amp; Participatory Spaces</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Engaging digital modules and interactive classroom sessions\r\n                        transform complex abstract theories into lively, multi-sensory\r\n                        experiences that invite student participation.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2. Project-Based Learning -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Experiential</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Project-Based Learning</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Real-World Problem Solving</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Students investigate real-life questions, build working\r\n                        scientific models, and conduct field experiments that connect\r\n                        textbook knowledge directly to the world around them.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3. Classroom Model -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-easel2-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Pedagogy</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Classroom Model</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Learner-Centric Environment</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtfully arranged classroom spaces replace passive\r\n                        lectures with lively Socratic dialogues, thematic learning\r\n                        stations, and supportive peer-teacher conversations.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 4. Learning Through Games -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-dice-5-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Gamified</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Learning Through Games</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Joyful Cognitive Mastery</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Structured educational games, mathematical puzzles, logic\r\n                        challenges, and language quests make mastering foundational\r\n                        concepts stimulating, memorable, and fun.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 5. Individualized Instruction -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Tailored</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Individualized Instruction</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Respecting Every Child’s Pace</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Personalized attention and diagnostic feedback ensure that\r\n                        every child receives the right balance of remedial reinforcement\r\n                        and advanced intellectual enrichment.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 6. Collaborative Learning Process -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Teamwork</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Collaborative Learning Process</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Synergy, Empathy &amp; Leadership</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Group investigations, peer tutoring, and team presentations\r\n                        foster active listening, cooperative problem solving, and mutual\r\n                        respect among diverse peer groups.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 7. Learning Through Play -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-balloon-heart-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Foundation</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Learning Through Play</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Early Childhood Discovery</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Particularly emphasized in pre-primary and early primary\r\n                        stages: tactile exploration, storytelling, music, arts, and\r\n                        role-play nurture innate curiosity and emotional wellness.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 8. Classroom with a Tech Infusion -->\r\n                <div class=\"tm-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-header\">\r\n                        <div class=\"tm-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-cpu-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <span class=\"tm-card-tag\">Digital</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <h3>Classroom with a Tech Infusion</h3>\r\n                    <span class=\"tm-card-sub\">Smart &amp; Purposeful Tools</span>\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-card-line\"></div>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtful integration of audiovisual aids, e-learning resources,\r\n                        and digital media enriches classroom discourse while maintaining\r\n                        essential handwriting and reading disciplines.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         3. 4-STAGE LEARNING JOURNEY\r\n    =========================================================  -->\r\n    <!-- <section class=\"tm-section tm-journey\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"tm-sec-label\">Learning Progression</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    The 4-Stage <em>Learning Cycle</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    How every lesson unfolds to ensure deep comprehension,\r\n                    practical mastery, and long-term retention.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"tm-journey-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">01</div>\r\n                    <h3>Spark &amp; Inquire</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Lessons open with thought-provoking questions, real-life\r\n                        scenarios, or intriguing demonstrations that spark natural\r\n                        curiosity and active questioning.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">02</div>\r\n                    <h3>Explore &amp; Experiment</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Students investigate through hands-on activities, educational\r\n                        games, digital simulations, and collaborative group tasks.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">03</div>\r\n                    <h3>Synthesize &amp; Mentor</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Teachers guide students to organize their findings, bridging\r\n                        practical observations with formal academic theories and\r\n                        individualized feedback.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"tm-journey-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"tm-journey-num\">04</div>\r\n                    <h3>Reflect &amp; Apply</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Learners demonstrate mastery by creating projects, solving novel\r\n                        problems, and reflecting on how their knowledge connects to life.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'teaching-methodology', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '53-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '2026-10-13 12:16:25', '', 53, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=54', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(55, 1, '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '    \r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         WELCOMING SECTION\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-welcome\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"cca-welcome-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-label\">Life Beyond Lessons</div>\r\n\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        A Space to Discover,<br>\r\n                        Create &amp; <em>Grow</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        At Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana, we believe\r\n                        that a child\'s education is not limited to the\r\n                        classroom. Co-curricular activities are an\r\n                        <strong>essential part of school life</strong> —\r\n                        giving every child the opportunity to explore\r\n                        their interests, discover hidden talents, and\r\n                        build confidence beyond academics.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        From the stillness of daily yoga to the energy of\r\n                        sports, from classical dance to community service,\r\n                        our activities are thoughtfully designed around the\r\n                        school\'s <strong>Panchangashikshan framework</strong> —\r\n                        nurturing the physical, intellectual, cultural,\r\n                        creative, and moral growth of every student.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-tags\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i> Yoga</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i> Sports</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i> Music</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i> Dance</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i> Karate</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i> Craft</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i> Service</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-co-curricular.jpg\"\r\n                            alt=\"Students engaged in co-curricular activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            title=\"Co-Curricular Activities and Student Life at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"cca-welcome-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                            Holistic co-curricular education and student activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana Kunjathur, fostering physical, cultural, and creative talents through Panchangashikshan.\r\n                        </figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-text\">\r\n                            <small>Beyond Academics</small>\r\n                            <strong>Every Child Grows</strong>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION — EXPLORE OUR ACTIVITIES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"cca-sec-label\">Explore Our Activities</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A World <em>Beyond the Classroom</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Every child at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana is\r\n                    encouraged to explore, create, and grow through a wide\r\n                    range of activities — from yoga and sports to music,\r\n                    dance, service, and the arts.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-activities-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1. Yoga & Meditation -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-yoga.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Yoga and Meditation at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Daily Yoga and Mindfulness Sessions for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Daily yoga and meditation practice cultivating inner calm, mental focus, mindfulness, and physical well-being among school students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Well-being</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Yoga &amp; Meditation</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Daily practice for physical and mental well-being —\r\n                            building stillness, focus, and inner calm that stays\r\n                            with the child for life.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2. Sports & Athletics -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-sports.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sports and Athletics at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sports and Athletic Coaching at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Comprehensive sports, track and field athletics, and outdoor physical education programs building teamwork, fitness, and championship spirit.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Fitness</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sports &amp; Athletics</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Team spirit, fitness, and healthy competition —\r\n                            with active participation in inter-school and\r\n                            district-level competitions.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3. Music & Classical Arts -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-music.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Music and Classical Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Classical Vocal and Instrumental Music Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Vocal and instrumental classical music coaching nurturing artistic expression, rhythmic discipline, and cultural appreciation.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Expression</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Music &amp; Classical Arts</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Vocal, instrumental, and classical music training —\r\n                            giving every child a joyful way to express emotion\r\n                            through sound and rhythm.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 4. Bharatanatyam -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-dance.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Traditional Bharatanatyam dance education connecting students to India\'s sacred artistic heritage through graceful rhythm, expression, and discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Culture</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Bharatanatyam</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Classical dance as a form of cultural expression —\r\n                            connecting students to India\'s artistic heritage\r\n                            with grace, discipline, and joy.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 5. Karate -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-karate.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Karate Martial Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Karate and Martial Arts Self-Defence Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Karate and martial arts coaching providing students with essential self-defence skills, physical strength, mental focus, and personal discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Discipline</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Karate</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Self-defence, discipline, and physical confidence —\r\n                            building strength of body, focus of mind, and\r\n                            respect for others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 6. Craft & Art -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-craft.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Craft and Art at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Creative Arts and Handicraft Workshops\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Creative art and handicraft workshops encouraging imaginative expression, fine motor skill development, and innovative design thinking.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Creativity</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Craft &amp; Art</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Creativity, imagination, and hands-on skill —\r\n                            giving every child the freedom to make, shape,\r\n                            and see the world in their own way.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 7. Farming Exposure -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-farming.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Farming Exposure at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Agricultural and Organic Farming Exposure for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Hands-on organic farming and agricultural exposure fostering respect for nature, agricultural roots, and dignity of labour.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Dignity of Labour</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-tree-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Farming Exposure</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Hands-on contact with farming and physical work —\r\n                            learning early that every form of honest effort\r\n                            deserves respect.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 8. Sanskrit & Heritage -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-sanskrit.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sanskrit and Heritage at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sanskrit Learning and Vedic Heritage Classes\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Sanskrit recitation, Vedic heritage classes, and cultural traditions instilling moral values, ethics, and ancient Indian wisdom.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Heritage</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sanskrit &amp; Heritage</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Cultural roots and ancient wisdom — introducing\r\n                            students to Sanskrit shlokas, Indian traditions,\r\n                            and the values that shape a life well-lived.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 9. Community Service -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-service.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Community Service at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Social and Community Service Programs\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Social outreach and community service initiatives cultivating empathy, civic responsibility, and active leadership among students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Service</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Community Service</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Learning to serve the school, the village, and the\r\n                            wider world — with humility, care, and a heart for\r\n                            others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'Co-Curricular activities', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'co-curricular-activities', '', '', '2026-10-14 10:29:08', '2026-10-14 10:29:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?page_id=55', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(56, 1, '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         WELCOMING SECTION\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-welcome\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"cca-welcome-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-label\">Life Beyond Lessons</div>\r\n\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        A Space to Discover,<br>\r\n                        Create &amp; <em>Grow</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        At Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana, we believe\r\n                        that a child\'s education is not limited to the\r\n                        classroom. Co-curricular activities are an\r\n                        <strong>essential part of school life</strong> —\r\n                        giving every child the opportunity to explore\r\n                        their interests, discover hidden talents, and\r\n                        build confidence beyond academics.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        From the stillness of daily yoga to the energy of\r\n                        sports, from classical dance to community service,\r\n                        our activities are thoughtfully designed around the\r\n                        school\'s <strong>Panchangashikshan framework</strong> —\r\n                        nurturing the physical, intellectual, cultural,\r\n                        creative, and moral growth of every student.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-tags\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i> Yoga</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i> Sports</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i> Music</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i> Dance</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i> Karate</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i> Craft</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i> Service</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-co-curricular.jpg\"\r\n                            alt=\"Students engaged in co-curricular activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            title=\"Co-Curricular Activities and Student Life at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"cca-welcome-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                            Holistic co-curricular education and student activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana Kunjathur, fostering physical, cultural, and creative talents through Panchangashikshan.\r\n                        </figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-text\">\r\n                            <small>Beyond Academics</small>\r\n                            <strong>Every Child Grows</strong>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION — EXPLORE OUR ACTIVITIES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"cca-sec-label\">Explore Our Activities</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A World <em>Beyond the Classroom</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Every child at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana is\r\n                    encouraged to explore, create, and grow through a wide\r\n                    range of activities — from yoga and sports to music,\r\n                    dance, service, and the arts.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-activities-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1. Yoga & Meditation -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-yoga.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Yoga and Meditation at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Daily Yoga and Mindfulness Sessions for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Daily yoga and meditation practice cultivating inner calm, mental focus, mindfulness, and physical well-being among school students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Well-being</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Yoga &amp; Meditation</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Daily practice for physical and mental well-being —\r\n                            building stillness, focus, and inner calm that stays\r\n                            with the child for life.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2. Sports & Athletics -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-sports.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sports and Athletics at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sports and Athletic Coaching at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Comprehensive sports, track and field athletics, and outdoor physical education programs building teamwork, fitness, and championship spirit.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Fitness</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sports &amp; Athletics</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Team spirit, fitness, and healthy competition —\r\n                            with active participation in inter-school and\r\n                            district-level competitions.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3. Music & Classical Arts -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-music.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Music and Classical Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Classical Vocal and Instrumental Music Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Vocal and instrumental classical music coaching nurturing artistic expression, rhythmic discipline, and cultural appreciation.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Expression</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Music &amp; Classical Arts</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Vocal, instrumental, and classical music training —\r\n                            giving every child a joyful way to express emotion\r\n                            through sound and rhythm.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 4. Bharatanatyam -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-dance.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Traditional Bharatanatyam dance education connecting students to India\'s sacred artistic heritage through graceful rhythm, expression, and discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Culture</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Bharatanatyam</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Classical dance as a form of cultural expression —\r\n                            connecting students to India\'s artistic heritage\r\n                            with grace, discipline, and joy.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 5. Karate -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-karate.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Karate Martial Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Karate and Martial Arts Self-Defence Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Karate and martial arts coaching providing students with essential self-defence skills, physical strength, mental focus, and personal discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Discipline</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Karate</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Self-defence, discipline, and physical confidence —\r\n                            building strength of body, focus of mind, and\r\n                            respect for others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 6. Craft & Art -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-craft.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Craft and Art at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Creative Arts and Handicraft Workshops\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Creative art and handicraft workshops encouraging imaginative expression, fine motor skill development, and innovative design thinking.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Creativity</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Craft &amp; Art</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Creativity, imagination, and hands-on skill —\r\n                            giving every child the freedom to make, shape,\r\n                            and see the world in their own way.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 7. Farming Exposure -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-farming.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Farming Exposure at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Agricultural and Organic Farming Exposure for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Hands-on organic farming and agricultural exposure fostering respect for nature, agricultural roots, and dignity of labour.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Dignity of Labour</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-tree-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Farming Exposure</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Hands-on contact with farming and physical work —\r\n                            learning early that every form of honest effort\r\n                            deserves respect.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 8. Sanskrit & Heritage -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-sanskrit.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sanskrit and Heritage at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sanskrit Learning and Vedic Heritage Classes\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Sanskrit recitation, Vedic heritage classes, and cultural traditions instilling moral values, ethics, and ancient Indian wisdom.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Heritage</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sanskrit &amp; Heritage</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Cultural roots and ancient wisdom — introducing\r\n                            students to Sanskrit shlokas, Indian traditions,\r\n                            and the values that shape a life well-lived.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 9. Community Service -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"images/images-from-media/cca-service.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Community Service at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Social and Community Service Programs\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Social outreach and community service initiatives cultivating empathy, civic responsibility, and active leadership among students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Service</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Community Service</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Learning to serve the school, the village, and the\r\n                            wider world — with humility, care, and a heart for\r\n                            others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'co-curricular-activities', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '55-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '2026-10-13 12:21:43', '', 55, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=56', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(57, 1, '2026-10-13 12:22:19', '2026-10-13 12:22:19', '\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         WELCOMING SECTION\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-welcome\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"cca-welcome-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-text\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-label\">Life Beyond Lessons</div>\r\n\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        A Space to Discover,<br>\r\n                        Create &amp; <em>Grow</em>\r\n                    </h2>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        At Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana, we believe\r\n                        that a child\'s education is not limited to the\r\n                        classroom. Co-curricular activities are an\r\n                        <strong>essential part of school life</strong> —\r\n                        giving every child the opportunity to explore\r\n                        their interests, discover hidden talents, and\r\n                        build confidence beyond academics.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        From the stillness of daily yoga to the energy of\r\n                        sports, from classical dance to community service,\r\n                        our activities are thoughtfully designed around the\r\n                        school\'s <strong>Panchangashikshan framework</strong> —\r\n                        nurturing the physical, intellectual, cultural,\r\n                        creative, and moral growth of every student.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-tags\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i> Yoga</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i> Sports</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i> Music</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i> Dance</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i> Karate</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i> Craft</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i> Service</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cca-welcome-visual\">\r\n                    <figure>\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-co-curricular.jpg\"\r\n                            alt=\"Students engaged in co-curricular activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            title=\"Co-Curricular Activities and Student Life at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"cca-welcome-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                            Holistic co-curricular education and student activities at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana Kunjathur, fostering physical, cultural, and creative talents through Panchangashikshan.\r\n                        </figcaption>\r\n                    </figure>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-welcome-badge-text\">\r\n                            <small>Beyond Academics</small>\r\n                            <strong>Every Child Grows</strong>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION — EXPLORE OUR ACTIVITIES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"cca-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-sec-head\">\r\n                <div class=\"cca-sec-label\">Explore Our Activities</div>\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A World <em>Beyond the Classroom</em>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Every child at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana is\r\n                    encouraged to explore, create, and grow through a wide\r\n                    range of activities — from yoga and sports to music,\r\n                    dance, service, and the arts.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"cca-activities-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- 1. Yoga & Meditation -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-yoga.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Yoga and Meditation at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Daily Yoga and Mindfulness Sessions for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Daily yoga and meditation practice cultivating inner calm, mental focus, mindfulness, and physical well-being among school students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Well-being</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Yoga &amp; Meditation</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Daily practice for physical and mental well-being —\r\n                            building stillness, focus, and inner calm that stays\r\n                            with the child for life.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 2. Sports & Athletics -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-sports.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sports and Athletics at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sports and Athletic Coaching at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Comprehensive sports, track and field athletics, and outdoor physical education programs building teamwork, fitness, and championship spirit.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Fitness</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sports &amp; Athletics</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Team spirit, fitness, and healthy competition —\r\n                            with active participation in inter-school and\r\n                            district-level competitions.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 3. Music & Classical Arts -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-music.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Music and Classical Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Classical Vocal and Instrumental Music Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Vocal and instrumental classical music coaching nurturing artistic expression, rhythmic discipline, and cultural appreciation.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Expression</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Music &amp; Classical Arts</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Vocal, instrumental, and classical music training —\r\n                            giving every child a joyful way to express emotion\r\n                            through sound and rhythm.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 4. Bharatanatyam -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-dance.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Bharatanatyam Classical Dance Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Traditional Bharatanatyam dance education connecting students to India\'s sacred artistic heritage through graceful rhythm, expression, and discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Culture</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Bharatanatyam</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Classical dance as a form of cultural expression —\r\n                            connecting students to India\'s artistic heritage\r\n                            with grace, discipline, and joy.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 5. Karate -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-karate.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Karate Martial Arts at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Karate and Martial Arts Self-Defence Training\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Karate and martial arts coaching providing students with essential self-defence skills, physical strength, mental focus, and personal discipline.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Discipline</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Karate</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Self-defence, discipline, and physical confidence —\r\n                            building strength of body, focus of mind, and\r\n                            respect for others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 6. Craft & Art -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-craft.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Craft and Art at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Creative Arts and Handicraft Workshops\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Creative art and handicraft workshops encouraging imaginative expression, fine motor skill development, and innovative design thinking.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Creativity</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Craft &amp; Art</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Creativity, imagination, and hands-on skill —\r\n                            giving every child the freedom to make, shape,\r\n                            and see the world in their own way.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 7. Farming Exposure -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-farming.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Farming Exposure at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Agricultural and Organic Farming Exposure for Students\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Hands-on organic farming and agricultural exposure fostering respect for nature, agricultural roots, and dignity of labour.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Dignity of Labour</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-tree-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Farming Exposure</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Hands-on contact with farming and physical work —\r\n                            learning early that every form of honest effort\r\n                            deserves respect.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 8. Sanskrit & Heritage -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-sanskrit.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Sanskrit and Heritage at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Sanskrit Learning and Vedic Heritage Classes\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Sanskrit recitation, Vedic heritage classes, and cultural traditions instilling moral values, ethics, and ancient Indian wisdom.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Heritage</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Sanskrit &amp; Heritage</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Cultural roots and ancient wisdom — introducing\r\n                            students to Sanskrit shlokas, Indian traditions,\r\n                            and the values that shape a life well-lived.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- 9. Community Service -->\r\n                <div class=\"cca-activity-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-img-wrap\">\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/images-from-media/cca-service.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Community Service at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                title=\"Social and Community Service Programs\"\r\n                                class=\"cca-card-img\"\r\n                                loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Social outreach and community service initiatives cultivating empathy, civic responsibility, and active leadership among students.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                        <span class=\"cca-card-tag-badge\">Service</span>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-card-icon-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"cca-card-body\">\r\n                        <h3 class=\"cca-act-title\">Community Service</h3>\r\n                        <div class=\"cca-act-line\"></div>\r\n                        <p class=\"cca-act-desc\">\r\n                            Learning to serve the school, the village, and the\r\n                            wider world — with humility, care, and a heart for\r\n                            others.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'co-curricular-activities', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '55-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 12:22:19', '2026-10-13 12:22:19', '', 55, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=57', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(58, 1, '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 1 — ELIGIBILITY RULES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Eligibility Rules</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Age <em>Criteria</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    Please review the age requirement before applying, to\r\n                    make sure your child is eligible for the class you wish\r\n                    to enrol them in.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-elig-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ao-elig-icon\">\r\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"ao-elig-body\">\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-elig-label\">Grade 1 Admission</span>\r\n                    <h3>6 Years Completed as on 31st March</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        To be admitted to <strong>Grade 1</strong>, the child\r\n                        must have completed <strong>6 years of age as on\r\n                        31st March</strong> of the admission year. This\r\n                        ensures they\'re ready to begin their formal schooling\r\n                        journey with confidence.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 2 — APPLICATION STEPS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section alt\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Application Steps</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Two Ways to <em>Apply</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    You can submit your admission application either directly\r\n                    at the school office or online — whichever is more\r\n                    convenient for you.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-apply-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-apply-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-apply-num\">01</div>\r\n                    <h3>Apply in Person</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Visit the school office and collect the prescribed\r\n                        admission form. Fill it out and submit it directly\r\n                        along with the required documents.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-apply-tag\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-building-fill\"></i>\r\n                        At School Office\r\n                    </span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-apply-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-apply-num\">02</div>\r\n                    <h3>Apply Online</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Complete the admission form online at your\r\n                        convenience, then submit it with the required\r\n                        documents and the online payment fee challan.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-apply-tag\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i>\r\n                        From Anywhere\r\n                    </span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 3 — IMPORTANT DATES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Mark Your Calendar</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Important <em>Dates</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    Admissions for the next academic year follow a clear\r\n                    yearly cycle — here are the dates you should keep in\r\n                    mind.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-dates-wrap\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-date-card opening\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-date-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-calendar2-plus-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-date-tag\">Admissions Open</span>\r\n                    <h3>Every January</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Admissions open <strong>every January</strong> for\r\n                        the next academic year. Parents are encouraged to\r\n                        apply early, as seats are limited and offered on a\r\n                        first-come basis.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-date-card closing\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-date-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-calendar2-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-date-tag\">Last Date to Apply</span>\r\n                    <h3>15th May</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The last date to submit the <strong>filled\r\n                        application</strong> along with the\r\n                        <strong>online payment fee challan</strong> is\r\n                        <strong>15th May</strong> every year.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Notice -->\r\n            <div class=\"ao-notice\">\r\n                <div class=\"ao-notice-icon\">\r\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-info-circle-fill\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"ao-notice-body\">\r\n                    <strong>Need help with your application?</strong>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        For assistance with the application form, documents\r\n                        or fee challan, please contact the school office at\r\n                        <a href=\"tel:+914998278940\">04998 278940</a>\r\n                        or email\r\n                        <a href=\"mailto:smvkunjathur@gmail.com\">smvkunjathur@gmail.com</a>.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'Admission Overview', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'admission-overview', '', '', '2026-10-14 10:20:56', '2026-10-14 10:20:56', '', 0, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?page_id=58', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(59, 1, '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 1 — ELIGIBILITY RULES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Eligibility Rules</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Age <em>Criteria</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    Please review the age requirement before applying, to\r\n                    make sure your child is eligible for the class you wish\r\n                    to enrol them in.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-elig-card\">\r\n                <div class=\"ao-elig-icon\">\r\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"ao-elig-body\">\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-elig-label\">Grade 1 Admission</span>\r\n                    <h3>6 Years Completed as on 31st March</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        To be admitted to <strong>Grade 1</strong>, the child\r\n                        must have completed <strong>6 years of age as on\r\n                        31st March</strong> of the admission year. This\r\n                        ensures they\'re ready to begin their formal schooling\r\n                        journey with confidence.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 2 — APPLICATION STEPS\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section alt\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Application Steps</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Two Ways to <em>Apply</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    You can submit your admission application either directly\r\n                    at the school office or online — whichever is more\r\n                    convenient for you.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-apply-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-apply-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-apply-num\">01</div>\r\n                    <h3>Apply in Person</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Visit the school office and collect the prescribed\r\n                        admission form. Fill it out and submit it directly\r\n                        along with the required documents.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-apply-tag\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-building-fill\"></i>\r\n                        At School Office\r\n                    </span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-apply-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-apply-num\">02</div>\r\n                    <h3>Apply Online</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Complete the admission form online at your\r\n                        convenience, then submit it with the required\r\n                        documents and the online payment fee challan.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-apply-tag\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i>\r\n                        From Anywhere\r\n                    </span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         SECTION 3 — IMPORTANT DATES\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n    <section class=\"ao-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-head\">\r\n                <span class=\"ao-eyebrow\">Mark Your Calendar</span>\r\n                <h2 class=\"ao-title\">Important <em>Dates</em></h2>\r\n                <p class=\"ao-sub\">\r\n                    Admissions for the next academic year follow a clear\r\n                    yearly cycle — here are the dates you should keep in\r\n                    mind.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"ao-dates-wrap\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-date-card opening\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-date-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-calendar2-plus-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-date-tag\">Admissions Open</span>\r\n                    <h3>Every January</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Admissions open <strong>every January</strong> for\r\n                        the next academic year. Parents are encouraged to\r\n                        apply early, as seats are limited and offered on a\r\n                        first-come basis.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"ao-date-card closing\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ao-date-icon\">\r\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-calendar2-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <span class=\"ao-date-tag\">Last Date to Apply</span>\r\n                    <h3>15th May</h3>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The last date to submit the <strong>filled\r\n                        application</strong> along with the\r\n                        <strong>online payment fee challan</strong> is\r\n                        <strong>15th May</strong> every year.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- Notice -->\r\n            <div class=\"ao-notice\">\r\n                <div class=\"ao-notice-icon\">\r\n                    <i class=\"bi bi-info-circle-fill\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"ao-notice-body\">\r\n                    <strong>Need help with your application?</strong>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        For assistance with the application form, documents\r\n                        or fee challan, please contact the school office at\r\n                        <a href=\"tel:+914998278940\">04998 278940</a>\r\n                        or email\r\n                        <a href=\"mailto:smvkunjathur@gmail.com\">smvkunjathur@gmail.com</a>.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'admission-overview', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '58-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '2026-10-13 12:30:21', '', 58, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=59', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(60, 1, '2026-10-14 03:10:23', '2026-10-14 03:10:23', '\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 1A — ABOUT THE INSTITUTION -->\r\n    <section class=\"about-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"about-heading\">\r\n                <div class=\"about-label\">About the Institution</div>\r\n                <h2 class=\"about-title\">\r\n                    Rooted in <span class=\"orange\">Tradition</span>,\r\n                    Growing with <span class=\"orange\">Purpose</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"about-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"about-text\">\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The school falls under the umbrella of the\r\n                        <strong>Shree Mahalingeshwara Temple Education Trust</strong>,\r\n                        a non-profit body affiliated with the temple of the same name.\r\n                        It is situated in a calm and tranquil location on the temple\r\n                        grounds in <strong>Kunjathur village</strong>, approximately\r\n                        3 kilometres from the town centre.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The institution is affiliated with\r\n                        <strong>NIOS (National Institute of Open Schooling), New Delhi</strong>,\r\n                        under the Right to Education Act of 2009. The school received\r\n                        accreditation under Reference No. F-27/1-6/2023/NIOS/SSS/OBE/Accr/EOBE/1142,\r\n                        dated 25.10.2024, with renewal accreditation confirmed under\r\n                        Accreditation No. OB0918317.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        The school\'s approach centres on giving children\r\n                        <strong>room to grow freely</strong>. Alongside the\r\n                        NCERT-guided curriculum, equal importance is given to\r\n                        meditation, physical activity, creative pursuits, and the\r\n                        principle of <strong>\"living in truth.\"</strong>\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        This philosophy shapes every academic and extracurricular\r\n                        activity offered. The school\'s signature\r\n                        <strong>\"Panchangashikshan\"</strong> framework structures\r\n                        learning around five core areas: Yoga, Sports, Music,\r\n                        Sanskrit, and moral education (Naithik).\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Beyond the classroom, students are encouraged to learn\r\n                        through experience — from meditation and yoga to music,\r\n                        Bharatanatyam, craft, and sports. The result is a school\r\n                        day that feels balanced: one that nourishes the mind,\r\n                        the body, and the character at the same time.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"about-tags\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i> Yoga</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-walking\"></i> Sports</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i> Music</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i> Bharatanatyam</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i> Karate</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i> Craft</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i> Sanskrit</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill\"></i> Naithik</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"about-visual\">\r\n                    <div class=\"about-image-wrap\">\r\n                        <div class=\"about-image-accent\"></div>\r\n                        <figure>\r\n                            <img\r\n                                src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-school-campus.jpg\"\r\n                                alt=\"Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana Kunjathur Campus\"\r\n                                title=\"Campus Infrastructure and Environment at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                class=\"about-image\"\r\n                            >\r\n                            <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                Tranquil school campus situated on temple grounds in Kunjathur, fostering peace of mind, focused study, and natural exploration.\r\n                            </figcaption>\r\n                        </figure>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"about-accreditation\">\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-building\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>NIOS, New Delhi</strong>\r\n                            <span>Affiliated Institution</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-patch-check-fill\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>OB0918317</strong>\r\n                            <span>Accreditation No.</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"accreditation-box\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check\"></i>\r\n                            <strong>25.10.2024</strong>\r\n                            <span>Renewal Date</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 1B — PANCHANGASHIKSHAN (mirrors Section 1A layout) -->\r\n    <section class=\"about-continuation\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"panchang-block\">\r\n\r\n                <!-- Left-aligned heading -->\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-heading\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-label\">Our Framework</div>\r\n                    <h3 class=\"panchang-title\">\r\n                        The <span>\"Panchangashikshan\"</span> Approach\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Grid: text left, featured image right (equal height) -->\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-grid\">\r\n\r\n                    <!-- LEFT — narrative -->\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-text-col\">\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            This philosophy shapes every academic and extracurricular\r\n                            activity offered. The school\'s signature\r\n                            <strong>\"Panchangashikshan\"</strong> framework structures\r\n                            learning around <strong>five core areas</strong> — each\r\n                            one playing a distinct role in the development of the\r\n                            whole child.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Rather than treating education as a single stream of\r\n                            academics, the framework weaves together the physical,\r\n                            the intellectual, the cultural, the artistic, and the\r\n                            moral. A child is not asked to choose between them —\r\n                            they are encouraged to hold all five together, so that\r\n                            what is learned becomes what is lived.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            This is not an add-on to the school day, but the rhythm\r\n                            of it. Every week, every activity, and every interaction\r\n                            is quietly shaped by these five streams — creating a\r\n                            learning environment where the mind and character grow\r\n                            together, and where a child leaves not just with\r\n                            knowledge, but with a way of being.\r\n                        </p>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-closing-note\">\r\n                            <p>\r\n                                Together, these five areas form the rhythm of a\r\n                                school day that nourishes both mind and character.\r\n                            </p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- RIGHT — featured image -->\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-visual-col\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-image-wrap\">\r\n                            <div class=\"panchang-image-accent\"></div>\r\n                            <figure>\r\n                                <img\r\n                                    src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/media/image4.png\"\r\n                                    alt=\"Students practicing Yoga and Meditation — Panchangashikshan at SMVK\"\r\n                                    title=\"Panchangashikshan Framework at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                                    class=\"panchang-image\"\r\n                                >\r\n                                <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">\r\n                                    Students practicing daily yoga and meditation as part of the five-fold Panchangashikshan holistic learning framework.\r\n                                </figcaption>\r\n                            </figure>\r\n                            <div class=\"panchang-image-tag\">\r\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                                <span>5 Pillars of Holistic Learning</span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Bottom Row — 5 Core Pillars as a balanced horizontal card grid -->\r\n                <div class=\"panchang-pillars-grid\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-pillar-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-pillar-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\">01</span>\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up panchang-pillar-icon\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h4>Yoga</h4>\r\n                        <p>Stillness, breath, and physical well-being — the foundation of a calm and focused mind.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-pillar-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-pillar-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\">02</span>\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-person-walking panchang-pillar-icon\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h4>Sports</h4>\r\n                        <p>Discipline, energy, and team spirit — learning to play, to win, and to lose with grace.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-pillar-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-pillar-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\">03</span>\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed panchang-pillar-icon\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h4>Music</h4>\r\n                        <p>Expression, rhythm, and creative confidence — both instrumental and classical.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-pillar-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-pillar-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\">04</span>\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half panchang-pillar-icon\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h4>Sanskrit</h4>\r\n                        <p>Heritage, language, and ancient wisdom — a living link to India\'s traditions.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"panchang-pillar-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"panchang-pillar-header\">\r\n                            <span class=\"panchang-pillar-num\">05</span>\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-heart-fill panchang-pillar-icon\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h4>Naithik</h4>\r\n                        <p>Moral education and inner character — the quiet strength that guides every choice.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- SECTION 2 — LEARNING ENVIRONMENT -->\r\n    <section class=\"learning-section\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"learning-heading\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"learning-title\">\r\n                    A Learning Environment<br>\r\n                    Built on <span class=\"orange\">Freedom &amp; Truth</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <p class=\"learning-sub\">\r\n                    Where academic learning meets moral, physical, cultural, and\r\n                    spiritual growth — nurturing every child completely.\r\n                </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"learning-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"learning-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"learning-card-media\">\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/media/image14.png\"\r\n                            alt=\"Smart Digital Classroom and Curriculum at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"learning-card-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <span class=\"learning-card-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i> Curriculum &amp; Opportunities\r\n                        </span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"learning-card-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"learning-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-book-half\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h3>Curriculum &amp; Opportunities</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Students have opportunities to learn and participate in\r\n                            <strong>karate, sports, music, Bharatanatyam dance, craft,\r\n                            and yoga</strong>. The curriculum also draws on India\'s ancient\r\n                            philosophical traditions, cultural legacy, and the wisdom of\r\n                            respected teachers worldwide, while introducing students to\r\n                            lesser-known figures from Indian history.\r\n                        </p>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"learning-tags\">\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-arms-up\"></i> Yoga</span>\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-walking\"></i> Sports</span>\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-music-note-beamed\"></i> Music</span>\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-flower1\"></i> Bharatanatyam</span>\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-hand-index-thumb\"></i> Karate</span>\r\n                            <span><i class=\"bi bi-palette\"></i> Craft</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"learning-card\">\r\n                    <div class=\"learning-card-media\">\r\n                        <img\r\n                            src=\"http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/wp-content/themes/custom-theme-child/assets/images/media/image104.png\"\r\n                            alt=\"Investiture and Value-Guided Learning at Shree Mahalingeshwara Vidyanikethana\"\r\n                            class=\"learning-card-img\"\r\n                        >\r\n                        <span class=\"learning-card-badge\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i> Holistic Development\r\n                        </span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"learning-card-body\">\r\n                        <div class=\"learning-card-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-stars\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <h3>Holistic Development</h3>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            The school places importance on <strong>holistic development</strong>,\r\n                            combining academic learning with moral, physical, cultural, and\r\n                            spiritual growth. Every child is encouraged to grow freely,\r\n                            rooted in the principle of <strong>\"living in truth.\"</strong>\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            Education here is not limited to the classroom — it is a way\r\n                            of life that shapes character, builds confidence, and prepares\r\n                            students to serve their community, their country, and humanity\r\n                            as a whole.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"learning-closing\">\r\n                <strong>Every child matters.</strong> Education · Values · Community.\r\n            </p>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n', 'overview', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-14 03:10:23', '2026-10-14 03:10:23', '', 9, 'http://localhost/shree-mahalingeshwara-vidyanikethana-kunjthoor/?p=60', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
